sequenceDiagram
    title Order flow
    autonumber
    actor U as User 😀
    participant W as Web App
    participant S as Service
    U->>+W: Place order
    W->>S: Create order #35;42
    activate S
    S-->>W: Accepted
    deactivate S
    loop Every minute
        W->>W: Poll status
    end
    alt paid
        S-)W: Payment ok
    else failed
        S-xW: Payment failed
    end
    Note over U,W: Customer sees result
    Note right of S: Audit log
    W-->>-U: Done
